title: Source Control lists the branches, the remotes, the tags and the stashes in sections, a right click on a branch makes a tag on it, and a stash is dropped after asking
folders: git-sidebar
expect-file: git-sidebar/.git/refs/tags/rel-1 :: ^[0-9a-f]{40}
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3500
left changes
wait 1500
mark a-sections
wait 500
ui click 100 576
wait 800
ui click 100 647
wait 1000
mark b-tags-and-stashes
wait 500
ui right 100 317
wait 1000
mark c-branch-menu
wait 500
ui click 180 454
wait 1000
type rel-1
wait 600
mark d-name-asked
wait 500
answer create
wait 2500
mark e-tag-made
wait 500
ui right 100 712
wait 1000
mark f-stash-menu
wait 500
ui click 150 795
wait 1000
mark g-drop-asked
wait 500
answer drop
wait 2500
mark h-stash-gone
wait 500
quit
